---
import BaseLayout from'../../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from'../../../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import LearningSection from'../../../../components/LearningSection.astro';
import Grade7Unit1CoordinateArcade from'../../../../components/Grade7Unit1CoordinateArcade.astro';
const base=import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<BaseLayout title="Unit 1 Math Arcade | Grade 7 Math" description="Apply Coordinates and Design in the Festival Grid Coordinate Rescue mission." themeColor="#2457c5"><div class="completion-page"><Breadcrumbs items={[{label:'Home',href:base},{label:'Grade 7 Math',href:`${base}courses/grade-7-math/`},{label:'Coordinates and Design'},{label:'Math Arcade'}]}/><header class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">GRADE 7 MATH · UNIT 1 COMPLETION</p><h1>Math Arcade <span>Coordinate Rescue</span></h1><p>Use the Unit 1 mathematics to restore a coordinate blueprint. This is an application game, not another multiple-choice check.</p><div class="sequence" aria-label="Unit completion sequence"><a href="../horizontal-vertical-distances/">1.4 Lesson</a><a href="../unit-review/">Unit Review</a><a href="../unit-check/">Unit Check</a><strong aria-current="step">Math Arcade</strong></div></header>
<LearningSection id="mission" eyebrow="AUTHENTIC APPLICATION" title="Festival Grid restoration mission" icon="🎮" tone="play"><p class="launch">Three design panels must be restored through coordinate transformations. The final dispatch mission then compares routes with the same start and finish. Points reward correct and efficient mathematical decisions, never speed.</p><Grade7Unit1CoordinateArcade/></LearningSection>
<LearningSection id="transfer" eyebrow="WHAT YOU ARE APPLYING" title="The whole Unit 1 chain" icon="🧠" tone="learn"><div class="transfer-grid"><article><strong>Locate</strong><p>Read and track integral ordered pairs on the Cartesian plane.</p></article><article><strong>Design</strong><p>Keep labelled vertices and corresponding points matched.</p></article><article><strong>Transform</strong><p>Use translations, reflections, rotations, and successive images.</p></article><article><strong>Compare movement</strong><p>Separate net horizontal/vertical change from total horizontal/vertical distance travelled.</p></article></div></LearningSection>
<LearningSection id="finish" eyebrow="UNIT 1 COMPLETE" title="Ready to leave Coordinates and Design?" icon="🏁" tone="review"><p>Unit 1 is complete when you can locate and reproduce coordinate designs, perform and describe the three transformations, track corresponding image vertices, and reason about horizontal and vertical positional change without using unsupported diagonal-distance methods.</p><div class="next-actions"><a href="../unit-check/">← Independent Unit Check</a><span class="coming" aria-disabled="true">Unit 2 begins only after its approved rebuild specification is verified.</span></div></LearningSection></div></BaseLayout>
<style>
.completion-page{max-width:1180px;margin:auto;padding:1rem}.hero{padding:2rem 0 2.5rem}.eyebrow{font-size:.76rem;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.08em;color:#607087}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(2.45rem,7vw,4.8rem);line-height:.98;margin:.35rem 0}.hero h1 span{display:block;color:#2457c5}.sequence{display:flex;gap:.45rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:1rem}.sequence a,.sequence strong{padding:.5rem .65rem;border-radius:999px;background:#eef3f9;color:#244260;text-decoration:none}.sequence strong{background:#2457c5;color:#fff}.launch{padding:.75rem;border-left:4px solid #2457c5;background:#eef6ff}.transfer-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.75rem}.transfer-grid article{padding:.9rem;border:1px solid #d7e1ee;border-radius:12px;background:#fff}.transfer-grid strong{font-size:1.05rem}.next-actions{display:flex;gap:.7rem;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center}.next-actions a{padding:.7rem .85rem;border-radius:9px;font-weight:850;color:#174ea6}.coming{padding:.7rem .85rem;border-radius:9px;background:#e8edf4;color:#526174;font-weight:750}.completion-page :focus-visible{outline:3px solid #ea8c00;outline-offset:3px}@media(max-width:700px){.transfer-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}@media(max-width:390px){.completion-page{padding:.7rem}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(2.15rem,11vw,3rem)}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.completion-page *{animation:none!important;transition:none!important;scroll-behavior:auto!important}}
</style>
